@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}
<div class="container about-main-container">
    <div class="about-hero">
        <p class="about-hero-label">▶ CLASSIFIED BRIEFING</p>
        <h1 class="about-hero-title">About SecretAgent Lab</h1>
        <p class="about-hero-subtitle">
            The most dangerous gadget marketplace in any known universe.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4 mt-2">
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="about-card about-card-accent">
                <p class="about-card-label">▶ OUR ORIGIN STORY</p>
                <p class="about-card-text">
                    In the shadowy aftermath of the Multiverse Collapse of 2019, a group of rogue engineers
                    and ex-S.H.I.E.L.D. technicians pooled their knowledge to create a single, unified
                    marketplace for the galaxy's most advanced spy equipment. Operating from an undisclosed
                    location somewhere between Earth-616 and Earth-1610, SecretAgent Lab was born.
                </p>
                <p class="about-card-text">
                    We don't just sell gadgets. We supply the tools that tip the balance between chaos and order,
                    between the mission and the mission gone wrong.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="about-card h-100">
                <p class="about-card-label">▶ BY THE NUMBERS</p>
                <div class="about-stat">
                    <span class="about-stat-number">47</span> <!-- Like Agent 47, I hope that's funny :) -->
                    <span class="about-stat-desc">Active Secret Agents</span>
                </div>
                <div class="about-stat">
                    <span class="about-stat-number">∞</span>
                    <span class="about-stat-desc">Parallel Universes Served</span>
                </div>
                <div class="about-stat">
                    <span class="about-stat-number">0</span>
                    <span class="about-stat-desc">Failed Missions (officially)</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="about-card h-100">
                <p class="about-card-label">▶ WHAT WE OFFER</p>
                <p class="about-card-text">From Stark-grade surveillance devices to Wakandan-inspired stealth tech — our agents source only the finest equipment from across the multiverse. Every gadget is field-tested, mission-approved, and aggressively classified.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="about-card h-100">
                <p class="about-card-label">▶ OUR AGENTS</p>
                <p class="about-card-text">Each agent in our network is a specialist — trained in covert operations, advanced technology, and the art of looking extremely cool under pressure. They curate their own gadget collections so you know exactly who to trust.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="about-card h-100">
                <p class="about-card-label">▶ DISCLAIMER</p>
                <p class="about-card-text">SecretAgent Lab operates in a fictional alternate universe. Any resemblance to actual spy agencies, comic book organizations, or shadowy government programs is entirely intentional and deeply plausible.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12">
            <div class="about-cta">
                <p class="about-cta-label">▶ READY FOR YOUR MISSION?</p>
                <p class="about-cta-text">Browse our catalog and equip yourself for whatever the multiverse throws at you.</p>
                <a asp-controller="Shop" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-primary">View Special Agents</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>